<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Delivery Information</h1>
    <p>Guidance for delivery expectations, order tracking, support evidence and what to do if a delivery issue occurs.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main-content">
  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Delivery process</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="step"><span class="number">1</span><b>Order placed</b><span>After checkout, keep your order ID and the phone number used during checkout.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">2</span><b>Seller fulfilment</b><span>The seller prepares the item based on the product listing, available stock and delivery details.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">3</span><b>Delivery coordination</b><span>Make sure the delivery address, phone number and availability are correct.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">4</span><b>Order tracking</b><span>Use the Track Order page for updates and use support if the order appears delayed or unclear.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Before accepting delivery</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="note">Where practical, check that the product received matches the product ordered before confirming completion.</div>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>What to look for</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Product identity</td><td>Product name, size, colour, model or variant where applicable.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Condition</td><td>Visible damage, missing parts, wrong item or packaging concerns.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Quantity</td><td>Confirm the number of items matches the order.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Payment evidence</td><td>Keep the M-PESA confirmation message if the item was paid through checkout.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Delivery evidence</td><td>Keep any relevant delivery communication if a dispute may arise.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">If delivery is delayed or wrong</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="warnBox">Submit a support request with your order ID, checkout phone number, product name, issue type and any evidence. Clear evidence helps support review the matter faster.</div>
      <div class="grid">
        <a class="tile" href="/track-order.html"><b>Track order</b><span>Check current order status.</span><em class="pill">tracking</em></a>
        <a class="tile" href="/support-request.html"><b>Submit support request</b><span>Report delayed, wrong, missing or damaged delivery.</span><em class="pill">support</em></a>
        <a class="tile" href="/returns-policy.html"><b>Returns policy</b><span>Review return and refund guidance.</span><em class="pill">returns</em></a>
        <a class="tile" href="/help-center.html"><b>Help Center</b><span>Open all customer support options.</span><em class="pill">help</em></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Delivery issue evidence</div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>When reporting a delivery issue, include the following where available:</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="tile"><b>Order ID</b><span>The order reference from checkout or tracking.</span></div>
        <div class="tile"><b>Checkout phone</b><span>The phone number used when placing the order.</span></div>
        <div class="tile"><b>Product details</b><span>Product name and seller if available.</span></div>
        <div class="tile"><b>Issue description</b><span>Explain whether the issue is delay, wrong item, damaged item or missing item.</span></div>
        <div class="tile"><b>Payment evidence</b><span>M-PESA receipt if payment was completed.</span></div>
        <div class="tile"><b>Photos or delivery notes</b><span>Keep evidence where practical before submitting support.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

